IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `qld-part09-distance-time-age`

-- Tests for Part 9, section 37 (qld-part09-distance-time-age.l4).
-- Each expected value was worked out by hand from the text, as cited.
-- Sections 38 and 38A are tested in qld-tests-time.l4.

§ `Tests of Part 9, s 37`

-- (3): suppose section 9 of the 2023 Amending Act commenced on 1 March 2023.
#ASSERT `the provision is a post-2023 provision (s 37(3))` (Date 2 3 2023) (Date 1 3 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the provision is a post-2023 provision (s 37(3))` (Date 1 3 2023) (Date 1 3 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the provision is a post-2023 provision (s 37(3))` (Date 28 2 2023) (Date 1 3 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the provision is a pre-2023 provision (s 37(3))` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the provision is a pre-2023 provision (s 37(3))` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the provision is a pre-2023 provision (s 37(3))` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- SAYS In applying a pre-2023 provision, distance is measured along the shortest road ordinarily used for travelling unless there is a contrary intention (s 37(1)); in applying a post-2023 provision, in a straight line on a horizontal plane (s 37(2)).
#ASSERT `how distance is measured in applying the provision (s 37(1) and (2))` FALSE `no contrary intention` EQUALS `along the shortest road ordinarily used for travelling`
#ASSERT `how distance is measured in applying the provision (s 37(1) and (2))` FALSE `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in a straight line on a horizontal plane` EQUALS `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
#ASSERT `how distance is measured in applying the provision (s 37(1) and (2))` FALSE `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in another way` EQUALS `in the other way the contrary intention requires`
#ASSERT `how distance is measured in applying the provision (s 37(1) and (2))` TRUE `no contrary intention` EQUALS `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
-- (2) has no "unless": a contrary intention does not displace it for a post-2023 provision
#ASSERT `how distance is measured in applying the provision (s 37(1) and (2))` TRUE `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in another way` EQUALS `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
